  "releaseNotes": "Breaking changes:\n- Apply() now receives SequencedEvent instead of IEvent (tags, metadata, position available in projections)\n- AppendAsync() gains a CancellationToken parameter\n- Tag, QueryItem, Metadata, DomainEvent, SequencedEvent are now immutable record types\n- options.AddContext() renamed to options.UseStore(); Contexts list replaced by StoreName string\n\nAdded:\n- IEventStoreMaintenance.AddTagsAsync — retroactively add tags to stored events (additive-only, no overwrites)\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/majormartintibor/Opossum/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
